  "question": {
    "text": "<p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mL</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> solution is mixed with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>600</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mL</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>MNaOH</mi></math> solution, the increase in temperature of the final solution is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8212;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>. (Round off to the nearest integer).</p><p>[Use :<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>:</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"\"><mrow><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>57</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Specific heat of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;, density of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Assume no change in volume of solution on mixing.</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "82",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>400</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1000</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>600</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1000</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Limiting</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Reagent</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Now we can apply,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ms</mi><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>57</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>&#916;T</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#916;T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8196</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>96</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>82</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p>"
  }
